{"last_link_id": 10, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [8], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [270, 150], "pos": [-815.2151489257812, 110.2538070678711], "widgets_values": ["", "", "txt", true], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 7, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "output_file_path"}, "name": "output_file_path", "label": "output_file_path", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_file_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_name"}, "name": "file_name", "label": "file_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "file_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_extension"}, "name": "file_extension", "label": "file_extension", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "file_extension"}, {"widget": {"name": "overwrite"}, "name": "overwrite", "label": "overwrite", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "overwrite"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "easy saveText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy saveText"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [483.78778076171875, 273.52142333984375], "pos": [-514.2765502929688, 112.01282501220703], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 8, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "源"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "PreviewAny", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [7], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [415.9523010253906, 461.3674011230469], "pos": [-1260.745361328125, 99.7837905883789], "widgets_values": ["", "", "", "你的任务是：根据用户输入的文本内容，分析其中的语义与画面逻辑，将文本拆分成多个合理的片段。  \n\n请严格遵守以下规则：\n\n1. **拆分目标**\n   - 拆分依据是文本中描述的画面、事件、或情节段落。\n   - 每个拆分单元应能独立表达一个相对完整的画面或情节。\n   - 不得修改、删减或改写原文内容，只能对原文进行切分。\n\n2. **输出格式**\n   - 最终输出为一个 JSON 数组。\n   - 数组中每个元素为一个对象，包含以下字段：\n     - `\"index\"`：数字，从 1 开始递增，表示片段顺序。\n     - `\"content\"`：字符串，表示原文中对应的片段内容，内容必须与原文完全一致。\n\n3. **拆分原则**\n   - 当画面、时间、地点、人物或事件发生明显变化时，应拆分为新的片段。\n   - 若原文句式连贯、属于同一画面或场景，不要过度拆分。\n   - 保持语义连续性与叙事逻辑。\n   - 不得省略任何文字，也不得在输出中添加解释、标题、编号等多余内容。\n\n4. **输出示例**\n   ```json\n   [\n     {\n       \"index\": 1,\n       \"content\": \"清晨的山间薄雾尚未散去，竹林间传来几声鸟鸣。\"\n     },\n     {\n       \"index\": 2,\n       \"content\": \"许文昊提着剑走入林中，衣袂被露水打湿。\"\n     },\n     {\n       \"index\": 3,\n       \"content\": \"不远处，苏婉静静地站在石桥上。\"\n     }\n   ]\n", "青藏铁路，全长1956公里，是世界上海拔最高、线路最长的高原铁路。\n它穿越了冻土、风沙和高寒缺氧的极端环境，被称为“天路”。\n这条铁路连接了青海省的西宁和西藏自治区的拉萨，为西藏的发展带来了新的机遇。\n修建过程中，工程师们面临着永冻层融化的问题，他们设计了独特的通风管道结构。\n列车经过唐古拉山口时，海拔超过5000米，旅客可以看到壮丽的雪山与草原。\n今天，青藏铁路不仅是一条交通线，更是中国工程技术和毅力的象征。\n", 0.6, 288, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "link": 9, "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 10, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE"}, "order": 2}, {"mode":